    "ui.disclaimer": "Numerology describes tendencies, not certainties. This report is not medical, legal or financial advice.",
    "ui.how_worked_out": "How this was worked out",
    "ui.how_to_read.1": "This report reads your numbers in three systems. The Vedic core uses your date of birth: the Mulank (your everyday nature) and the Bhagyank (your life's direction). The Chaldean system reads your name. The Pythagorean system adds the Western core numbers.",
    "ui.how_to_read.2": "Each number is linked to a planet, and planets get along with some planets and not others. That friendship shapes how your numbers work together, how well your name suits you, and which numbers, days and colours help you.",
    "ui.how_to_read.3": "Every number shows how it was worked out, and the appendix lists every calculation, so you or any numerologist can check it. Use the report as a mirror for reflection and planning, not as a fixed prediction.",
    "ui.closing": "May these numbers help you understand yourself a little better and choose your steps with confidence. With warm wishes from KalaChakra.",
    "ui.keep_in_mind": "Three things to keep in mind",
    "ui.no_missing": "Every number from 1 to 9 is present in your Lo Shu grid, so no remedies are needed for missing numbers.",
